<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: everflower -->
  <VV_Everflower.label>永盛花</VV_Everflower.label>
  <!-- EN: It is a very rare arcane flower, treated as a sacred flower by the Vivi. Although its specific cultivation methods are not known, it is occasionally found alongside other arcane plants.\n\nIt periodically releases a large amount of pollen. When an adult Vivi gathers honey from this flower, it has the ability to convert biological age into mana, absorbing it to reverse aging.\n\nThe scent of the everflower has a strong sedative effect, but the Vivi have some resistance to it, allowing only them to gather the honey. However, a single Vivi cannot gather honey repeatedly. -->
  <VV_Everflower.description>一種非常罕見的神秘花朵，被薇薇視為神圣之花。雖然它的具體培養方法尚不清楚，但偶爾也會與其他神秘植物中被發現。\n\n永盛花會周期性地釋放大量花粉。當成年薇薇從這種花上采集蜂蜜時，她們的年齡會被永盛花轉化為魔能，后者會吸收這種魔能來逆轉薇薇的衰老。\n\n永盛花的香氣有很強的鎮靜作用，但薇薇對它們有一定抵抗力，所以只有薇薇能采集它的花蜜。然而，同一名薇薇不能重復采集。</VV_Everflower.description>
  
</LanguageData>